          "l": 90.024,
          "t": 235.86414,
          "r": 155.3,
          "b": 241.09998,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "The major objective of ENME 431 is to have the student understand the fluid systems",
          "l": 90.024,
          "t": 262.556,
          "r": 504.876,
          "b": 268.01,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "used in nuclear power plants, including the design bases and safety requirements.  A",
          "l": 90.024,
          "t": 276.356,
          "r": 497.5,
          "b": 281.81,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "student who successfully completes ENME 431 is able to demonstrate the ability to:",
          "l": 90.024,
          "t": 290.01416,
          "r": 480.7,
          "b": 295.25,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "1. Understand the major fluid systems used in nuclear power plants.",
          "l": 108.02,
          "t": 316.2471,
          "r": 429.67,
          "b": 321.65,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "2. Understand the design bases and safety requirements for the major fluid systems used",
          "l": 108.02,
          "t": 342.76712,
          "r": 522.6669,
          "b": 348.17,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "in nuclear power plants.",
